       \n    \n    \n            <article data-autopogo=\"\">\n                        <p>Late night TV is often at its best when it's at its weirdest, and watching Jon Stewart argue for five minutes with an animated version of <a href=\"https://mashable.com/tech/meta-muse-report-ai-assistant-keeps-track-of-family-friends\" target=\"_blank\" data-ga-click=\"1\" data-ga-label=\"$text\" data-ga-item=\"text-link\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\">Meta's Muse</a> <a href=\"https://mashable.com/category/artificial-intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" data-ga-click=\"1\" data-ga-label=\"$text\" data-ga-item=\"text-link\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\">AI</a> agent is a strong example.</p><p>In the clip above, the <a href=\"https://mashable.com/category/the-daily-show\" target=\"_blank\" data-ga-click=\"1\" data-ga-label=\"$text\" data-ga-item=\"text-link\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\"><em>Daily Show</em></a> host takes a deep dive into artificial intelligence, starting with <a href=\"https://mashable.com/entertainment/daily-show-trump-ai-summit\" target=\"_blank\" data-ga-click=\"1\" data-ga-label=\"$text\" data-ga-item=\"text-link\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\">Trump's recent summit</a> and moving on to the question of <a href=\"https://mashable.com/tech/anthropic-ai-researcher-quit-ethics-safety\" target=\"_blank\" data-ga-click=\"1\" data-ga-label=\"$text\" data-ga-item=\"text-link\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\">whether or not AI will be the end of humanity</a>.</p><p>Watching him attempt to voice the Muse AI while essentially arguing with himself is the highlight, though.</p><section>\n        <section data-ga-module=\"offer-group\" data-ga-element=\"offer-group\" data-commerce-block=\"\">\n            <p>Recommended deals for you</p>\n                            <p>\n                    <a href=\"https://cc.mashable.com/v1/otc/03bCs1jQxEftXGkZ7A6Km1e?merchant=05kie42h3YvHwjr4G1w80Qq&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0FQFB8FMG&template=video&module=offer-g