ime.","zh":"他报道娱乐和网络文化，并在业余时间写恐怖小说。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                \n    \n    \n        \n    <p>\"I can see right through this cutesy act of yours, Muse!\"</p>\n    <div>\n\n        <div>\n                                        &#160;<p>By</p><div aria-describedby=\"flyout\" x-data=\"{ showAuthor: false }\" @mouseover=\"showAuthor = true\" @mouseout=\"showAuthor = false\" @click=\"showAuthor = !showAuthor\" @click.outside=\"showAuthor = false\">\n                                    <p>萨姆·海瑟姆</p><div x-show=\"showAuthor\" x-cloak=\"\" aria-label=\"Author Bio Flyout\" role=\"tooltip\" id=\"flyout\">\n            \n            \n            <div>\n                    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/authors/01sT0oXtE6IeRNrRLduLq1X/image.fill.size_200x200.v1624381011.jpg\" alt=\"Mashable Image\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></p><div>\n                        <p>萨姆·海瑟姆</p>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            <p>Sam Haysom 是英国 Mashable 的总作业编辑。 他报道娱乐和网络文化，并在业余时间写恐怖小说。</p>\n                            <p>阅读完整的简历</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                                                                                                                            &#160;<p>on October 6, 2026</p></div>\n        <p>分享到 Facebook 分享到 Twitter 分享到 Flipboard</p>\n    </div>\n\n    \n</div><section data-seamless=\"\" data-ga-module=\"content_body\">\n                        \n    \n    \n            <article data-autopogo=\"\">\n                        <p>Late night TV is often at its best when it's at its weirdest, and watching Jon Stewart argue for five minutes with an animated version of Meta's Muse AI agent is a strong example.</p><p>In the clip above, the Daily Show host takes a deep dive into artificial intelligence, starting with Trump's recent summit and moving on to the question of whether or not AI will be the end of humanity.</p><p>Watching him attempt to voice the Muse AI while essentially arguing with himself is the highlight, though.</p><section>\n        <section data-ga-module=\"offer-group\" data-ga-element=\"offer-group\" data-commerce-block=\"\">\n            <p>Recommended deals for you</p>\n                            <p>Apple AirPods Pro 3 Noise Cancelling Heart Rate Wireless Earbuds — $179.00 (List Price $249.00)</p>\n                            <p>Sony WH-1000XM5 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones — $198.00 (List Price $399.99)</p>\n                            <p>Ring Indoor Cam Plus 2K Wired Security Camera (2-Pack, White) — $59.98 (List Price $119.98)</p>\n                            <p>Apple iPad 11\" 128GB Wi-Fi Retina Tablet (Blue, 2025 Release) — $399.00 (List Price $449.00)</p>\n                            <p>Ring 2nd Gen 2K Wired Video Doorbell With Chime (2026 Release) — $49.99 (List Price $114.98)</p>\n                            <p>Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Plus Streaming Player With Remote (2025 Model) — $37.99 (List Price $69.99)</p>\n                            <p>Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS, 42mm, S/M Black Sport Band) — $349.99 (List Price $399.00)</p>\n                            <p>Blink Outdoor 4 1080p 3-Camera Kit With Sync Module Core + Doorbell — $65.99 (List Price $259.98)</p>\n                    </section>\n                                    <p>可通过附属链接购买产品。 如果您通过我们网站上的链接购买商品，Mashable 可能会赚取联属佣金。</p>\n                        </section>\n<p>想要更多深夜的精彩吗？ 订阅 Mashable 的热门故事时事通讯。</p>\n\n                            \n                    </article>\n    \n    \n            <div>\n            <div>\n                    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/authors/01sT0oXtE6IeRNrRLduLq1X/image.fill.size_100x100.v1624381011.jpg\" alt=\"Mashable Image\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n                </div>\n            <p>Sam Haysom 是英国 Mashable 的总作业编辑。 他报道娱乐和网络文化，并在业余时间写恐怖小说。</p>\n        </div>\n  